| G1 Shadow green | All DP/RP/MV/CO specs exit 0 on CI | `workspace-metadata-*-parity.spec.ts` |
| G2 Ingress wired | P3-A-N-011 — tenant-aware resolve on live persist when `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=true` via `validateCanonicalBeforePersistAsync`; sync path only when flag off or worker-thread | IG-01…IG-08 · [`canonical-validation.ts`](../../apps/api/src/tours/canonical-validation.ts) |
| G3 Export drift | Live Denali export checksum === committed `denali-v1.json` | DP-01 |
| G4 Golden parity | Metadata path accepts/rejects same violation fieldIds as package | DP-05 |
