## Render plan parity

For a synthetic canonical shell covering all `wizard.roots`:

```typescript
const packagePlugin = resolveWorkspacePluginForType("denali");
const seed = loadDenaliSeedExport();
const metadataPlugin = adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin(seed.payload, packagePlugin);

const engineA = PlatformWizardEngine.create(denaliPluginForWizardEngine(packagePlugin));
const engineB = PlatformWizardEngine.create(denaliPluginForWizardEngine(metadataPlugin));

const shell = buildDenaliCanonicalShell(packagePlugin.wizard.roots);
const planA = engineA.buildRenderPlan({ data: shell, dimensions: { category: "mountain" } });
const planB = engineB.buildRenderPlan({ data: shell, dimensions: { category: "mountain" } });
```

Assert per step:

- Same visible field count (RP-01)
- Same ordered `fieldId` list (RP-02)
- Same `uiHints.compositeId` for composite fields (RP-03)
- Denali seed retains `denali.*` ids — not rewritten to `platform.*` (RP-04)

Metadata path must **not** rewrite composite ids to `platform.*` for Denali seed — alias map is for **new** verticals only (P3-B).

