## New metadata vertical (starter + platform.*)

Proof that P3-B/C path works without Denali package field layout:

1. Export starter: `pnpm --filter @apps/api run export:workspace-definition -- --workspace starter --out /tmp/starter-v1.json`
2. Author `climbing-club-v1` via builder publish (P3-C) **or** use `starter-shell` export as fixture
3. `provision-metadata-vertical.mjs` — create smoke tenant with `workspaceType: "starter"`, assign definition
4. Operator wizard loads `platform.*` composites (requires P3-B codegen + bindings)

This tenant proves metadata platform v1 — **not** Denali deprecation.

| Export preset | definitionId | workspaceType |
|---------------|--------------|---------------|
| denali | `denali-tour-ops` | `denali` |
| starter | `starter-shell` | `starter` |
| urban | `urban-minimal` | `urban` (parity optional) |

