## Per-tenant cutover runbook

### Enable (staging pilot)

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Merge P3-D parity specs green on CI (G1) |
| 2 | Confirm P3-A-N-011 ingress wired (G2) |
| 3 | Deploy API with `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=true` (staging) |
| 4 | Set allowlist to pilot tenant UUID(s) if using N-007 helper |
| 5 | Super Admin assign `denali-tour-ops` v1 on pilot club |
| 6 | Smoke: operator create/edit/publish tour |
| 7 | Monitor validation error rate vs baseline (§ Observability) |

### Rollback

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Super Admin → clear workspace definition binding (PATCH null) |
| 2 | Or remove tenant from `WORKSPACE_METADATA_TENANT_ALLOWLIST` |
| 3 | Or set `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=false` (environment rollback) |
| 4 | **No** canonical tour migration required — package path resumes immediately |

Audit trail: existing `TENANT_DEFINITION_CLEARED` event.

