## Observability during pilot

Per [Averroa guardrails](https://averroa.com/insights/enterprise-software-workflow-automation-insights/custom-development-integration/strangler-fig-pattern-decompose-a-monolith-safely/) — no routing without end-to-end monitoring.

| Signal | Where | Alert threshold (staging pilot) |
|--------|-------|--------------------------------|
| `CANONICAL_VALIDATION_FAILED` rate | API logs / metrics | > 2× baseline for pilot tenant |
| `WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_NOT_FOUND` | loader throws | any occurrence → rollback |
| Validation engine cache misses | P3-A engine cache key | spike after binding change |
| Operator 5xx on `/tours/*` | HTTP metrics | any sustained increase |

Log fields (existing): `tenantId`, `workspaceType`, `definitionId`, `definitionVersion` when metadata path active.

