## Metadata-only mode (deferred post-v1)

Today `adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin` **requires** package overlay — metadata-only plugin fails `assertWorkspacePlugin`.

Future (not P3-D gate):

- Minimal `@app-tour/workspace-starter` overlay providing noop hooks + `platform` composite surface
- Or inject synthetic overlay in loader for `supportedWorkspaceTypes: ["metadata-only"]`

Document coexist path in assessment; do not implement in P3-D unless Architect expands scope.

