## Optional env — tenant allowlist (N-007)

```typescript
// apps/api/src/workspace-metadata/is-workspace-metadata-enabled-for-tenant.ts
export function isWorkspaceMetadataEnabledForTenant(tenantId: string): boolean {
  if (!isWorkspaceMetadataEnabled()) return false;
  const raw = process.env.WORKSPACE_METADATA_TENANT_ALLOWLIST?.trim();
  if (!raw) return true;
  const allowed = new Set(raw.split(",").map((s) => s.trim()).filter(Boolean));
  return allowed.has(tenantId);
}
```

Wire into `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant` / `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantById` before DB load — empty allowlist = all tenants (when flag on).

Pass `tenantId` through `ResolveWorkspacePluginForTenantInput` (extend type in N-007).

