  → P3-D-N-012 phase exit

P3-A-N-011 (ingress wiring) — hard prerequisite for live cutover, not for CI parity specs
P3-B-N-014 — required for MV-03 platform.* vertical proof (MV-03 may skip with documented reason if P3-B not merged)
```

